  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_4523.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda ha festejado este domingo a su patr&oacute;n, con misa y procesi&oacute;n por la tarde,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_4628.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>y con el tradicional espect&aacute;culo de variedades nocturno con artistas del propios barrio y otras personas que han colaborado, entre ellas las reinas de la Fira 2012, Carmina Ramos Alfonso y Paula Mas iserte.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4465.jpg\" alt=\"img_4465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4467.jpg\" alt=\"img_4467\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4468.jpg\" alt=\"img_4468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4470.jpg\" alt=\"img_4470\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4471.jpg\" alt=\"img_4471\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4472.jpg\" alt=\"img_4472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiumengefestessantjoaquim13/img_4473.jpg\" alt=\"img_4473\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdiu